Image data processed using Experiment_ProfileFeat.ipynb

Timelapse contents:
- Biomass density profiles for swim plate macrocolonies for 6-20 hours (scaled by average biomass density)
- Macrocolony spreading distance over time
- Bulk biomass density dynamics (scaled by average biomass density)
- Measured biomass density and pyocyanin at t = 20 hours

Single-tpoint contents:
- Biomass density profiles for swim plate macrocolonies at t = 20 hours
- Measured biomass density and pyocyanin at t = 20 hours

Growth-curve_M9Glucose.xlsx: OD600 absorbance of 96-well PA14-wild type and del metH in M9-glucose

Pyocyanin-Discrete-tpoints_M9Glucose.csv: Measured pyocyanin concentration in swim plate assays at t = 10, 16, and 20 hours
